          "comment": "",
          "imagePath": null,
          "timeout": 5000,
          "confidence": 0.8,
          "keyHtml": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E\uD83C\uDF81\u0026nbsp;Utilize o cupom\u0026nbsp;\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003EVOLTESEMPRE\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E\u0026nbsp;e tenha 12% de desconto na sua pr\u00F3xima compra!!\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E(n\u00E3o funciona para itens de Robux. Gamepass)\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan data-token=\u0022{Enter}\u0022\u003E{Enter}\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
          "keyMarkdown": "\uD83C\uDF81\u00A0Utilize o cupom\u00A0*VOLTESEMPRE*\u00A0e tenha 12% de desconto na sua pr\u00F3xima compra!!\n\n(n\u00E3o funciona para itens de Robux. Gamepass){Enter}",
